"This product exists for one thing: efficiency. I am tired, I am working — the agent runs, and I wait. That time should not be wasted" = "做这个产品的初心只有一件事：效率。我很困、我在干活，agent 在跑、我在等——这段时间不该被浪费";
"It is open source so that every developer — everyone vibe coding — can claim that efficiency too. That is the whole origin" = "开源它，是想让每个开发者、每个在 vibe coding 的人，都把这份效率拿回去。这就是全部的原点";
"If you like it, share it, or leave a star on GitHub — that is the biggest help you can give me" = "如果你喜欢它，发到社交媒体，或者在 GitHub 点一颗 star，这就是对我最大的帮助";

"Welcome back to Agent Island" = "欢迎继续使用 Agent Island";
"start Antigravity to read quota" = "启动 Antigravity 后可读取配额";
"Installed — run agy to sign in" = "已安装 — 运行 agy 登录";
"Not detected — sign in with the antigravity CLI" = "未检测到 — 用 antigravity CLI 登录";
"sessions monitored — quota reading not wired yet" = "会话已监控 — 配额读取尚未接通";
"The fifth seat changes hands: Antigravity replaces Gemini — Google's gradient, a real weekly quota, resume to the exact conversation — and every alarm now lands back in the terminal you actually use" = "第五席易主：Antigravity 接替 Gemini——谷歌渐变、真实周额度、精确续跑；\n每个弹窗都能跳回你正在用的那个终端";
"Antigravity arrives" = "Antigravity 登岛";
"Google retired Gemini Code Assist for individuals, so Antigravity takes the slot: live session state, weekly quota read from its own local service, and one click back to the exact conversation" = "Google 关停个人版 Gemini Code Assist，Antigravity 顶上：\n实时会话状态、本地服务直读周额度、一键回到原对话";
"Back to your terminal" = "回到你的终端";
"An alarm click lands in the session's live window — Terminal, Ghostty, iTerm, or an IDE pane. Fresh windows open in the terminal you actually use, learned by watching rather than by asking" = "点弹窗直达会话所在的窗口——Terminal、Ghostty、iTerm 或 IDE 面板；\n需要新开时，也开在你惯用的终端里，靠观测学会，无需设置";
"Apple alarm tones" = "苹果闹钟铃声";
"Radar, Beacon, Slow Rise — the alarm rings with Apple's own tones, played straight from the system's ringtone library. Radar is the new default" = "Radar、Beacon、Slow Rise——弹窗铃声来自系统自带的苹果铃声库，默认 Radar";
"Cost across all five" = "五家成本全覆盖";
"Grok reports its own dollars, Cursor counts its tokens — cost and reports now cover every agent, read locally, and say so honestly where a provider publishes less" = "Grok 自报美元、Cursor 提供 token 计数——成本与报表覆盖五家，全部本地读取；\n上游没有的数据，如实标注";
